00:58:44.080 --> 00:59:07.630
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can listen to our archive of over 600 episodes for absolutely free. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Special thanks as always to our program's cofounder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he bought an obedience book for his dog. I don't think he knows how to use it. He just basically put the book on the ground next to her and told her--

00:59:07.630 --> 00:59:10.920
<v Paula>There you go. You read that, girl.

00:59:10.920 --> 00:59:15.920
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
